Z||000000||RFMike||06-11-2000||12:04 PM||||Greetings,<BR>Just wanted to let anybody that might care know that I haven't disappeared form the face of the earth.  I have been busy for the last 2 weeks putting the finishing touches on our new houseplans, and getting subcontracting bids for it.  I have had major withdrawal symptoms resulting from not getting my daily dose of the Forum.  A lot of stuff has happened, including an original member dealing with cancer.  <BR>I may miss a major part of the summer, since I am contracting the house, and doing a large portion of the work myself (foundation, flatwork, framing, siding, roofing, painting, and trim).  Top all that off with a 50 hour work week and 10-12 hours of commuting, and I will be AWOL from the Forum.  <BR>I miss you guys!<BR>This will probably be my last post for a long time, unless I can clone myself.||||reg||13
